          <h4 class=\"feed-card-title\">NASA unveils phased plan for lunar base</h4>\n                            <p class=\"feed-card-desc\"><strong>$20B Base Plan</strong>: The agency unveiled a $20 billion South Pole base plan with habitats, rovers, and nuclear power systems for long-term missions.</p>\n                            <div class=\"feed-card-expanded\">\n                              <ul class=\"feed-expanded-bullets\">\n                                <li><strong>$20B Base Plan</strong>: The agency unveiled a $20 billion South Pole base plan with habitats, rovers, and nuclear power systems for long-term missions.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Construction Timeline</strong>: Construction begins in 2032, with first crew rotations planned for 2035 using Artemis infrastructure under development.</li>\n                                <li><strong>International Partners</strong>: International partners ESA and JAXA will contribute habitation modules and life-support tech to reduce costs.</li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"feed-see-more-wrap\"><button class=\"feed-see-more\">See more <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/chevron-down.svg\" alt=\"\"/></button></div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Card 2: Astronaut -->\n                        <div class=\"feed-card\">\n                          <div class=\"feed-card-img-wrap\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-card-img\" src=\"/feed/article-astronaut.webp\" alt=\"Astronaut\"/>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"feed-card-body\">\n                            <div class=\"feed-card-meta\">\n                              <div class=\"feed-card-badges\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-publisher-icon\" src=\"/feed/quantis.svg\" alt=\"\"/>\n                                <span>Quantis</span>\n                                <span class=\"feed-meta-sep\">·</span>\n                                <span>1h</span>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"feed-like-btn\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/like.svg\" alt=\"Like\"/>\n                                <span>142</span>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <h4 class=\"feed-card-title\">Astronaut evacuated from ISS pays tribute to 'incredible teammates'</h4>\n                            <div class=\"feed-takeaways-header\">Key takeaways <span>· Curated by Copilot</span></div>\n                            <p class=\"feed-card-desc\"><strong>Medical Evacuation</strong>: Astronaut Mike Fincke, 58, required urgent medical attention aboard the ISS, prompting NASA's first-ever medical evacuation in 65 years.</p>\n                            <div class=\"feed-card-expanded\">\n                              <ul class=\"feed-expanded-bullets\">\n                                <li><strong>Medical Evacuation</strong>: Astronaut Mike Fincke, 58, required urgent medical attention aboard the ISS, prompting NASA's first-ever medical evacuation in 65 years.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Team Praise</strong>: Fincke praised his teammates and hospital staff for their professionalism, highlighting the importance of teamwork during emergencies.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Onboard Ultrasound</strong>: The crew used the onboard ultrasound to manage the event, proving its value for future spaceflights.</li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"feed-see-more-wrap\"><button class=\"feed-see-more\">See more <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/chevron-down.svg\" alt=\"\"/></button></div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Short Card Group -->\n                        <div class=\"feed-short-group\">\n                          <h4 class=\"feed-short-title\">Your AM scroll starter pack</h4>\n                          <div class=\"feed-shorts-row\">\n                            <div class=\"feed-short\">\n                              <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/short1.webp\" alt=\"Short 1\"/>\n                              <video class=\"feed-short-video\" src=\"/feed/short1.mp4\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"></video>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-gradient\"></div>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-info\">\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-publisher\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-short-pub-icon\" src=\"/feed/brim.svg\" alt=\"\"/> Brim <span class=\"feed-meta-sep\">·</span> 1d</span>\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-label\">iOS 26 Liquid Glass</span>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"feed-short\">\n                              <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/short2.webp\" alt=\"Short 2\"/>\n                              <video class=\"feed-short-video\" src=\"/feed/short2.mp4\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"></video>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-gradient\"></div>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-info\">\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-publisher\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-short-pub-icon\" src=\"/feed/contoso.svg\" alt=\"\"/> Contoso <span class=\"feed-meta-sep\">·</span> 1d</span>\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-label\">Here is What we know About the new Space</span>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"feed-short\">\n                              <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/short3.webp\" alt=\"Short 3\"/>\n                              <video class=\"feed-short-video\" src=\"/feed/short3.mp4\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"></video>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-gradient\"></div>\n                              <div class=\"feed-short-info\">\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-publisher\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-short-pub-icon\" src=\"/feed/quantis.svg\" alt=\"\"/> Quantis <span class=\"feed-meta-sep\">·</span> 1d</span>\n                                <span class=\"feed-short-label\">Home-made Cosmic Brownies?</span>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Card 3: F1 -->\n                        <div class=\"feed-card\">\n                          <div class=\"feed-card-img-wrap\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-card-img\" src=\"/feed/article-f1.png\" alt=\"F1\"/>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"feed-card-body\">\n                            <div class=\"feed-card-meta\">\n                              <div class=\"feed-card-badges\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-publisher-icon\" src=\"/feed/metro-sports.svg\" alt=\"\"/>\n                                <span>Metro Sports</span>\n                                <span class=\"feed-meta-sep\">·</span>\n                                <span>1d</span>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"feed-like-btn\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/like.svg\" alt=\"Like\"/>\n                                <span>89</span>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <h4 class=\"feed-card-title\">Here is What we Know About the new Speed Record</h4>\n                            <div class=\"feed-takeaways-header\">Key takeaways <span>· Curated by Copilot</span></div>\n                            <p class=\"feed-card-desc\"><strong>Speed Records</strong>: The latest developments in Formula 1 racing push boundaries once again with unprecedented speed records.</p>\n                            <div class=\"feed-card-expanded\">\n                              <ul class=\"feed-expanded-bullets\">\n                                <li><strong>Speed Records</strong>: The latest developments in Formula 1 racing push boundaries once again with unprecedented speed records.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Aero Regulations</strong>: New aero regulations for 2025 allow higher cornering speeds, with lap times dropping by nearly two seconds at several circuits.</li>\n                                <li><strong>Sustainable Fuels</strong>: Engine manufacturers are exploring sustainable fuel blends that reduce carbon emissions by up to 65%.</li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"feed-see-more-wrap\"><button class=\"feed-see-more\">See more <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/feed/chevron-down.svg\" alt=\"\"/></button></div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Card 4: Vogue -->\n                        <div class=\"feed-card\">\n                          <div class=\"feed-card-img-wrap feed-video-wrap\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"feed-card-img\" src=\"/feed/video-thumbnail.webp\" alt=\"Vogue\"/>\n                      