class=\"petcare-cal-day\">1</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">2</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">3</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">4</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">5</span>\n                        <span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">6</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">7</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">8</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day petcare-cal-today\">9</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">10</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">11</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">12</span>\n                        <span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">13</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">14</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">15</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day petcare-cal-selected\">16</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">17</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">18</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">19</span>\n                        <span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">20</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">21</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">22</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">23</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">24</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">25</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">26</span>\n                        <span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">27</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">28</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">29</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day\">30</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day petcare-cal-muted\">1</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day petcare-cal-muted\">2</span><span class=\"petcare-cal-day petcare-cal-muted\">3</span>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p3-continue\">Continue</div>\n                  </div>\n                  <!-- Page 4: Confirm Pet Info -->\n                  <div class=\"petcare-page4\">\n                    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"petcare-p4-bg\" src=\"/petcare/confirm-screen.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"petcare-back-btn petcare-back-btn-p4\">\n                      <svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M13 7H1M1 7L7 1M1 7L7 13\" stroke=\"#292F30\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"petcare-p4-title\">Book Appointment</p>\n                    <p class=\"petcare-p4-section\">Which pet needs care?</p>\n                    <p class=\"petcare-p4-subtitle\">Choose the pet we'll be caring for during this visit.</p>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p4-pets\">\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p4-pet\">\n                        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/petcare/pet-ben.webp\" alt=\"Ben\">\n                        <span class=\"petcare-p4-pet-name\"><svg class=\"petcare-paw-icon\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"10.5\" rx=\"2.5\" ry=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/></svg> Ben</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p4-pet petcare-p4-pet-selected\">\n                        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/petcare/pet-jerry.webp\" alt=\"Jerry\">\n                        <span class=\"petcare-p4-pet-name\"><svg class=\"petcare-paw-icon\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"10.5\" rx=\"2.5\" ry=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/></svg> Jerry</span>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"petcare-p4-info-title\">Basic Information</p>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-card\">\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-row\">\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Name</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">Jerry</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Species</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">Dog</span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-row\">\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Gender</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">Male</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Breed</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">Welsh Corgi</span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-row\">\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Date of Birth</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">June 5, 2017</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p4-info-col\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-label\">Age</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p4-value\">7 years old</span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p4-confirm\">Confirm</div>\n                  </div>\n                  <!-- Page 5: Booking Confirmation -->\n                  <div class=\"petcare-page5\">\n                    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"petcare-p5-bg\" src=\"/petcare/booking-confirmed-bg.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"petcare-p5-illustration\" src=\"/petcare/lightbulb-illustration.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                    <p class=\"petcare-p5-heading\">Your appointment for <span class=\"petcare-p5-pet-name\">Jerry</span><br>has been confirmed!</p>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p5-card\">\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p5-card-top\">\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p5-card-title\">\n                          <svg class=\"petcare-p5-paw\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"10.5\" rx=\"2.5\" ry=\"1.5\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/></svg>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p5-card-pet\">Jerry — Dental Care</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <svg class=\"petcare-p5-dots\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"3\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#292F30\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#292F30\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#292F30\"/></svg>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p5-card-date\">\n                        <svg class=\"petcare-p5-cal-icon\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"2\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#292F30\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><path d=\"M1 5.5h12\" stroke=\"#292F30\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><path d=\"M4.5 0.5v2.5M9.5 0.5v2.5\" stroke=\"#292F30\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n                        <span>Wed, Nov 16, 2022  |  5:30 PM</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p5-card-divider\"></div>\n                      <div class=\"petcare-p5-card-doctor\">\n                        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"petcare-p5-doc-avatar\" src=\"/petcare/vet-avatar.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                        <div class=\"petcare-p5-doc-info\">\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p5-doc-name\">Dr. Tiffany Mason</span>\n                          <span class=\"petcare-p5-doc-role\">Veterinarian</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <svg class=\"petcare-p5-bookmark\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 13\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M1 1h8v11L5 9.5 1 12V1z\" fill=\"#38A55A\"/></svg>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"petcare-p5-home-btn\">Back to Home</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"petcare-phone-frame\" src=\"/consumption/eatup/phone-frame.webp\" alt=\"\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.behance.net/gallery/148459767/Inside\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"project-card card-phone card-link\" data-project=\"inside\">\n            <div class=\"project-card-header\">\n              <h3 class=\"card-title\">How do I find furniture that fits my space</h3>\n              <span class=\"card-meta\">Inside · 2021 <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"arrow-icon\" src=\"/arrow-play.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"phone-frame\">\n              <div class=\"phone-screen inside-screen\">\n                <div class=\"inside-frame\">\n                  <!-- Background -->\n                  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"inside-bg\" src=\"/inside/bg.webp\" alt=\"\">\n              