ue\" class=\"w-grid24-col-span-4 m:w-full aspect-[1/1] relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] block m:mb-24fx\">\n                              <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A watercolor illustration of a soundwave with soft, overlapping peaks in green, pink, and yellow tones on a light gray background.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1-32x32.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1-375x375.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png 610w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/transcribe-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"w-full h-full object-contain scale-out\"  style=\"--animation-delay: 0.4s\"/>\n                          </a>\n            <div class=\"grow-1 space-y-26fx\">\n\n              <div class=\"space-x-grid24-col-offset-1 flex items-center jusitfy-start w-full m:block m:space-x-0 m:mb-30fx\">\n                <div class=\" w-grid24-col-span-8 grow-1 space-y-26fx m:w-full m:mb-20fx m:space-y-12fx\">\n                  <div class=\"text-caption\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-10fx text-caption\">\n                        <span class=\"tracking-[1.5px] text-ui  font-[500] m:tracking-[1.2px]\">\n                          Foundational model                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <h3 class=\"h4 m:h7\">\n                    <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-transcribe-1-5/\">\n                      MAI-Transcribe-1.5                    </a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div class=\"hidden\">\n                    <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-transcribe-1-5/\" class=\"button--primary is-simple\" >\n            Learn more\n        </a>                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-regular mlg:text-[calc(21_*_var(--unit-fx-type))] m:text-[calc(18_*_var(--unit-fx-type))] w-grid24-col-span-6 m:w-full\">\n                  Turn noisy audio into precise, domain-specific transcripts, with leading FLEURS and Artificial Analysis accuracy scores.                </p>\n              </div>\n                              <div>\n                  <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-transcribe-1-5/\" class=\"button--primary is-simple\" >\n            Learn more\n        </a>                </div>\n                          </div>\n  \n          </div>\n   \n      </div>\n       \n      <div aria-label=\"\" tab-button\n          class=\"-mx-39fx px-39fx py-36fx w-auto flex items-center justify-between m:mx-0 m:px-0 m:w-full m:py-0 m:mb-90fx rounded-4fx bg-[#FEF9ED] slide-up d:hover:shadow-[0_0_74.4px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]\"\n          style=\"--animation-delay: 0.5s\"\n          >\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-start space-x-grid24-col-space-1 w-full m:block\">\n            <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-voice-2/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-grid24-col-span-4 m:w-full aspect-[1/1] relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] block m:mb-24fx\">\n                              <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two watercolor speech bubbles overlapping on a light background; one bubble is pink and yellow, the other is green.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1-32x32.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1-375x375.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png 610w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_Voice-5-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"w-full h-full object-contain scale-out\"  style=\"--animation-delay: 0.5s\"/>\n                          </a>\n            <div class=\"grow-1 space-y-26fx\">\n\n              <div class=\"space-x-grid24-col-offset-1 flex items-center jusitfy-start w-full m:block m:space-x-0 m:mb-30fx\">\n                <div class=\" w-grid24-col-span-8 grow-1 space-y-26fx m:w-full m:mb-20fx m:space-y-12fx\">\n                  <div class=\"text-caption\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-10fx text-caption\">\n                        <span class=\"tracking-[1.5px] text-ui  font-[500] m:tracking-[1.2px]\">\n                          Foundational model                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <h3 class=\"h4 m:h7\">\n                    <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-voice-2/\">\n                      MAI-Voice-2                    </a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div class=\"hidden\">\n                    <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-voice-2/\" class=\"button--primary is-simple\" >\n            Learn more\n        </a>                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-regular mlg:text-[calc(21_*_var(--unit-fx-type))] m:text-[calc(18_*_var(--unit-fx-type))] w-grid24-col-span-6 m:w-full\">\n                  Delivers expressive, low-latency speech that holds up across long generations.                </p>\n              </div>\n                              <div>\n                  <a href=\"https://microsoft.ai/models/mai-voice-2/\" class=\"button--primary is-simple\" >\n            Learn more\n        </a>                </div>\n                          </div>\n  \n          </div>\n   \n      </div>\n          </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"text-center\">\n      <a href=\"/models\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" style=\"--custom-background-color: #5D524B; --custom-text-color: #F7ECD9;\">\n            All models\n        </a>    </div>\n\n  </scroll-object>\n\n</section>\n\n<!-- block-content-tabs -->\n<section\n    data-bg-fade=\"#f4e8c8\"\n    data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n    style=\"background: #f4e8c8;\"\n    class=\"d:pt-320fx m:my-200fx\"\n    >\n    <div class=\"max-width-max mx-auto\">\n\n        <scroll-object class=\"block mx-auto w-grid24-col-span-14 text-center m:w-full\">\n                            <h2 class=\"h3 mb-30fx d:mb-110fx\">\n                    <split-text by=\"lines\">At MAI, we’re building the world’s most capable AI systems, with humanity at the center of every decision.</split-text>\n                </h2>\n                        <div>\n                <p class=\"text-large-alt m:text-regular leading-[1.2]\">\n                    <split-text by=\"lines\" delay=\"0.2\">\n                        Humanist Superintelligence means building the world&#8217;s most advanced AI systems designed to stay controllable, aligned, and firmly in service of humanity.                    </split-text>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </scroll-object>\n        \n        <core-tabs class=\"d:mt-288fx block mx-auto flex items-center justify-between px-grid24-col-offset-2 m:px-0\">\n\n            <div \n                role=\"tablist\" \n                class=\"w-grid24-col-span-5 space-y-44fx m:hidden\">\n                            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-14 flex items-center justify-between m:w-full m:block m:space-y-74fx\">\n                            </div>\n\n        </core-tabs>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<!-- block-values -->\n<block-values class=\"relative block max-width-max mx-auto !m:pb-0 m:!pb-0 m:mt-144fx\" style=\"padding-bottom: 700vh;\">\n\n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full m:relative m:relative m:h-auto\">\n\n    <div class=\"top-0 sticky flex items-center justify-start pb-190fx h-100vh m:!h-auto m:static m:pb-0 m:block\">\n      \n      <div class=\"w-full\">\n      \n        <svg shape mode=\"connect\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"  viewBox=\"0 0 407 179\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M1 37C24.5 23.5 65 2 140.5 2C199.5 2 265.5 32 265.5 76C265.5 111 211.467 137.5 163 137.5C125.5 137.5 79.5 118 79.5 93C79.5 73 103 62.5 135.5 62.5C203 62.5 239 121.5 239 158.5C239 189.5 211 180 211 143.5C211 117.988 241.5 38 406 32.5\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg shape mode=\"underline\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 40\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M1 20.0006C50.5 4.5 145 0.99977 197 2.50102C149.333 4.16806 51.2 13.7021 28 30.5021C19.7256 36.4939 25.5 39.5105 42 37.5021C74 33.6071 152 11.5021 221.5 11.5021C260 11.5021 282.5 18.001 298.5 24.5021\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg shape mode=\"connect\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 458 160\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M1 152C118 176 219.5 121 219.5 85.5C219.5 71.5 207 64.5 187.5 64.5C152.5 64.5 122.5 86.5 122.5 107.5C122.5 133 151 148 196 148C271 148 312.028 95.6215 350 55C393 9 430.5 1.5 457.5 1.5\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg  shape mode=\"connect\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 390 210\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M1 208L389 2\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg shape mode=\"circled\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 505 127\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M449.5 35.1743C310.5 8.12448 2 -0.0414939 2 74.473C2 108.158 58 125 195 125C415 125 503 83.1492 503 48.9544C503 17.8214 450.5 2 368.5 2C269.5 2 175 23.4377 138.5 38.7469\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg shape mode=\"start\" dash-length=\"1075\" stroke-dasharray=\"1075\" stroke-dashoffset=\"1075\" class=\"m:hidden top-0 left-0 absolute pointer-events-none opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 84 91\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M1.876 57.558L23 89.5C30 72.5 44.5 35 82.2346 1.56918\" stroke=\"#5D524B\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"bevel\"/>\n        </svg>\n        \n        <h2 class=\"px-grid24-col-offset-2  h4 mb-190fx text-center m:px-0 m:mb-54fx\">\n          Our Values        </h2>\n\n        <div class=\"pl-grid24-col-offset-2  relative m:p-0\">\n          <div class=\"\">\n\n            <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between w-full m:hidden\">\n              <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 m:w-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Kindness                    </h3><br>\n                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Trust                    </h3><br>\n                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Quality                    </h3><br>\n                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Simplicity                    </h3><br>\n                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Safety &#038; Security                    </h3><br>\n                                      <h3 class=\"h3 inline-block w-auto cursor-pointer opacity-55 [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:opacity-100 [.accessibility-mode_&#038;]:opacity-100 is-active:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out\" title>\n                      Evaluation                    </h3><br>\n                                                </div>\n              <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 relative flex items-start justify-start d:pr-grid24-col-offset-2 m:w-full\">\n                                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: 0%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 m:w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">How we work shapes what we build. A team that communicates with care and makes space for different perspectives builds better.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: -100%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 m:w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">Trust is earned through consistency and honesty. We&#8217;re as clear about our limits as we are about our strengths.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: -200%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 m:w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">We aspire to create the very best models in the world: accurate, reliable, and genuinely useful across the work that matters most.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: -300%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 m:w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">We design for clarity so you can focus on the work, not the technology.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: -400%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">We believe responsible and capable AI aren&#8217;t in tension. We build with privacy, security, and human rights in mind.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                 \n                    <div class=\"relative w-full  align-top shrink-0 \" style=\"left: -500%;\">\n                      <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 m:w-full relative\">\n                        <div text class=\"transition-opacity duration-[0.6s] ease-out opacity-0 is-active:opacity-100  inline-block h5\" >\n                          <split-text auto-animate=\"false\">We test rigorously, listen closely, and improve constantly. Our models get better because we never stop measuring.</split-text>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                              </div>\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"hidden m:!block\">\n                                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Kindness                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      How we work shapes what we build. A team that communicates with care and makes space for different perspectives builds better. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Trust                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      Trust is earned through consistency and honesty. We&#8217;re as clear about our limits as we are about our strengths. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Quality                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      We aspire to create the very best models in the world: accurate, reliable, and genuinely useful across the work that matters most. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Simplicity                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      We design for clarity so you can focus on the work, not the technology. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Safety &#038; Security                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      We believe responsible and capable AI aren&#8217;t in tension. We build with privacy, security, and human rights in mind. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                  <div class=\"m:py-29fx\" style=\"border-top: solid 1px rgba(95, 78, 65, 0.50);\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-button-label mb-24fx bg-[#5D524B] text-[#FBF4E5] rounded-5fx p-18fx inline-block\">\n                      Evaluation                    </h3>\n                    <br/>\n                    <p text class=\"px-18fx h4 m:px-0\" >\n                      We test rigorously, listen closely, and improve constantly. Our models get better because we never stop measuring. \n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                                          </div> \n\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</block-values>\n\n<!-- block-portal -->\n\n\n<block-portal class=\"block relative m:!pt-0 m:my-144fx m:!mb-70fx\">\n\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" \n        data-slides-container class=\"pointer-events-none fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-100dvh\"  \n        style=\"position: fixed; perspective: 100dvh; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; left: 0px; top: 0.001px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n                            <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 7;\n                    left: 5vmax;                                                                                width: 25vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 646 / 865;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A woman with curly brown hair, wearing a dark gray long-sleeve turtleneck, stands against a neutral background, looking slightly to the side and smiling softly.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009-32x46.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png 273w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Group-2117134009.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 6;\n                                        right: -15vmax;                    top: 15vmax;                                        width: 40vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 506 / 759;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A person with short dark hair wearing a navy blue sweater stands outdoors against a clear blue sky, looking slightly to the side with a gentle smile and hands behind their back.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1-32x40.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1-375x469.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png 585w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MAI_2025_Portraits_Mustafa_Suleyman-65Fullsize-6-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 5;\n                    left: -15vmax;                                                                                width: 40vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 501 / 515;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Person in a bright yellow sweater sitting at a counter, drinking from a white cup and looking at a smartphone, with a blurred indoor background.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1-32x33.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png 310w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-6849-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 4;\n                    left: -2vmax;                                                            bottom: -10vmax;                    width: 30vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 536 / 781;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A woman wearing glasses and a black hijab smiles while sitting indoors. The background is softly lit and out of focus, creating a warm atmosphere.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1-32x30.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png 273w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-7066-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 3;\n                                        right: -10vmax;                    top: 2vmax;                                        width: 40vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 845 / 591;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A city street at sunset with historic, ornate buildings featuring towers and domes; golden sunlight casts long shadows, and a few pedestrians and cars are visible on the quiet road.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7-32x43.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png 310w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/000162720008-Large-7.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 2;\n                                        right: -6vmax;                    top: 10vmax;                                        width: 25vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 561 / 830;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A man wearing glasses and a light purple shirt sits at a table with a lanyard around his neck, smiling and holding a paper cup. Other people are seated around him, and the setting appears to be a conference or seminar.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2-32x39.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png 310w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/travistrautt_-8090-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    <div data-slide class=\"absolute overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" \n                style=\"\n                    opacity: 0;\n                    z-index: 1;\n                                        right: -15vmax;                                        bottom: -10vmax;                    width: 40vmax;                    aspect-ratio: 506 / 759;                \">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A man in a tan polo shirt smiles while standing outdoors against a partly cloudy sky, with palm tree leaves visible in the background.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2-32x40.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png 310w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Travistrautt_MAI_MIAMI-8680-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover top-0 left-0\" />\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n    <div data-content-container class=\"relative opacity-0 pointer-events-none top-0 d:h-100dvh w-full flex items-center justify-center text-center m:relative m:opacity-100\">\n        <div class=\"max-width-max mx-auto w-grid24-col-span-12 relative block space-y-50fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                        <h2 class=\"h6 mb-[0.9em]\">\n                <split-text auto-animate=\"false\" by=\"lines\">Join us</split-text>\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"wysiwyg\">\n                <split-text auto-animate=\"false\" by=\"lines\"><p>We’re a lean, talent-dense team of explorers, researchers, and full-stack engineers. We move fast, sweat the details, and operate at frontier scale with a roadmap to build the world’s most powerful AI models. Most importantly, we’re united by the belief that doing this right is the only way to do it at all.<br />\n <br />\nIf our mission resonates with you, we’d love to talk.</p>\n</split-text>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"/career\" class=\"button--primary\" style=\"--custom-background-color: #F7ECD9;\">\n            Explore jobs\n        </a>   \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</block-portal>\n\n<!-- block-locations -->\n<block-locations class=\"block __mb-[150vh] m:!mb-70fx\">\n    \n    <div class=\"text-center pt-440fx m:pt-140fx pb-240fx m:pb-0 m:mb-0 m:pt-0\">\n \n        <div class=\"max-width-max mx-auto\">\n\n            <scroll-object data-locations-header class=\"flex items-center justify-center flex-col m:!mb-0\" >\n                                    <h2 class=\"h4 m:h3 mb-[0.5em]\">\n                        <split-text>Key Locations</split-text>\n                    </h2>\n                                <p class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                    We have offices in cities across the globe. <br />\r\nWhere will you join?                </p>\n            </scroll-object>\n\n            <div class=\"relative \">\n\n                                                    <article \n                        class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-100vh pointer-events-none m:!mb-44fx m:pointer-events-auto [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:h-auto :h-auto\"\n                        data-bg-fade=\"#f4faf1\"\n                        data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n                        data-slide\n                        >\n                        <div data-slide-inner class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:relative m:!relative\">\n                            <h3 data-slide-title class=\"h1 relative m:mb-30fx\" style=\"z-index:2;\">\n                                Mountain View                            </h3>\n                            <div data-slide-image class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 aspect-[268/214] mx-auto relative max-h-[30vh] mb-30fx m:w-full\" >\n                                <div \n                                    class=\"absolute h-full w-full top-0 left-0\"  \n                                    style=\"\n                                        background-color: var(--background-color);\n                                        transition: background-color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut), color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut);\n                                    \">\n                                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colorful illustration of a coastal cityscape with red-roofed houses, a wide blue river, boats, and a large red suspension bridge spanning the water under a bright sky.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743-32x21.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743-375x250.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743-768x512.png 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743-1024x683.png 1024w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png 1206w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png 1206w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png 1206w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png 1206w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png 1206w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416743.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-contain top-0 left-0 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <p data-slide-text class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 mb-76fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                                Sunlit sprawl between the bay and the coastal hills, in the restless heart of the technology industry, where founders, bold ideas, and ambition are never in short supply.                            </p>\n                            <a href=\"/careers\" section-focus=\"\" data-slide-button=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore Mountain View Jobs\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" style=\"--custom-background-color: #e3efdd;\">\n            Explore Jobs\n        </a>                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                                    <article \n                        class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-100vh pointer-events-none m:!mb-44fx m:pointer-events-auto [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:h-auto :h-auto\"\n                        data-bg-fade=\"#fbf6e1\"\n                        data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n                        data-slide\n                        >\n                        <div data-slide-inner class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:relative m:!relative\">\n                            <h3 data-slide-title class=\"h1 relative m:mb-30fx\" style=\"z-index:2;\">\n                                Redmond                            </h3>\n                            <div data-slide-image class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 aspect-[268/214] mx-auto relative max-h-[30vh] mb-30fx m:w-full\" >\n                                <div \n                                    class=\"absolute h-full w-full top-0 left-0\"  \n                                    style=\"\n                                        background-color: var(--background-color);\n                                        transition: background-color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut), color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut);\n                                    \">\n                                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colorful illustration of people relaxing on a grassy hill in an urban park with tall buildings, trees, and a snow-capped mountain in the background under a blue sky with clouds.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1-32x22.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1-375x263.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1-768x539.png 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1-1024x719.png 1024w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png 1088w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/image-2065416747-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-contain top-0 left-0 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <p data-slide-text class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 mb-76fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                                Where Microsoft began – set among the evergreen forests, lakes, and mountains of the Pacific Northwest, a calm and grounded place built for deep work and the long view.                            </p>\n                            <a href=\"/careers\" section-focus=\"\" data-slide-button=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore Redmond Jobs\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" style=\"--custom-background-color: #f6ebc6;\">\n            Explore Jobs\n        </a>                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                                    <article \n                        class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-100vh pointer-events-none m:!mb-44fx m:pointer-events-auto [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:h-auto :h-auto\"\n                        data-bg-fade=\"\"\n                        data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n                        data-slide\n                        >\n                        <div data-slide-inner class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:relative m:!relative\">\n                            <h3 data-slide-title class=\"h1 relative m:mb-30fx\" style=\"z-index:2;\">\n                                New York                            </h3>\n                            <div data-slide-image class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 aspect-[268/214] mx-auto relative max-h-[30vh] mb-30fx m:w-full\" >\n                                <div \n                                    class=\"absolute h-full w-full top-0 left-0\"  \n                                    style=\"\n                                        background-color: var(--background-color);\n                                        transition: background-color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut), color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut);\n                                    \">\n                                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colorful sketch of a busy city square with crosswalks, taxis, people walking, green spaces, and tall buildings filled with bright billboards and advertisements.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1-32x24.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1-375x287.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1-768x587.png 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1-1024x783.png 1024w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png 1088w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png 1088w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_tightly_framed_New_York_city_scene_with_free_ed_b6d9e337-d392-4eef-9e16-b4b0cb322f47_3-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-contain top-0 left-0 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <p data-slide-text class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 mb-76fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                                Positioned among landmark architecture, tree-lined plazas, and one of Manhattan&#8217;s liveliest creative quarters. With the city&#8217;s culture right at its doorstep, it&#8217;s a hub of innovation and energy.                            </p>\n                            <a href=\"/careers\" section-focus=\"\" data-slide-button=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore New York Jobs\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" >\n            Explore Jobs\n        </a>                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                                    <article \n                        class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-100vh pointer-events-none m:!mb-44fx m:pointer-events-auto [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:h-auto :h-auto\"\n                        data-bg-fade=\"#f9fdfc\"\n                        data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n                        data-slide\n                        >\n                        <div data-slide-inner class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:relative m:!relative\">\n                            <h3 data-slide-title class=\"h1 relative m:mb-30fx\" style=\"z-index:2;\">\n                                London                            </h3>\n                            <div data-slide-image class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 aspect-[268/214] mx-auto relative max-h-[30vh] mb-30fx m:w-full\" >\n                                <div \n                                    class=\"absolute h-full w-full top-0 left-0\"  \n                                    style=\"\n                                        background-color: var(--background-color);\n                                        transition: background-color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut), color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut);\n                                    \">\n                                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colorful illustration of an outdoor café scene with people sitting at tables, a red double-decker bus, green kiosk, street lamps, tall buildings, and leafy trees under a bright, blue sky.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1-32x32.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1-375x375.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1-768x768.png 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png 854w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Warmly_colored_tightly_cropped_Iconic_London_sc_680c9aea-d6b0-4f07-8492-c4ccd2d05b1e_0-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-contain top-0 left-0 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <p data-slide-text class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 mb-76fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                                A global capital where centuries of history meet a thriving AI scene, alive with the talent and ideas shaping what comes next.                            </p>\n                            <a href=\"/careers\" section-focus=\"\" data-slide-button=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore London Jobs\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" style=\"--custom-background-color: #e6efee;\">\n            Explore Jobs\n        </a>                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                                    <article \n                        class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-100vh pointer-events-none m:!mb-44fx m:pointer-events-auto [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:h-auto :h-auto\"\n                        data-bg-fade=\"\"\n                        data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n                        data-slide\n                        >\n                        <div data-slide-inner class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center [.reduced-motion_&#038;]:relative m:!relative\">\n                            <h3 data-slide-title class=\"h1 relative m:mb-30fx\" style=\"z-index:2;\">\n                                Zurich                            </h3>\n                            <div data-slide-image class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 aspect-[268/214] mx-auto relative max-h-[30vh] mb-30fx m:w-full\" >\n                                <div \n                                    class=\"absolute h-full w-full top-0 left-0\"  \n                                    style=\"\n                                        background-color: var(--background-color);\n                                        transition: background-color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut), color 1.1s var(--alias-easeOut);\n                                    \">\n                                                                            <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colorful painting of a European cityscape with red and pink buildings, trees lining the streets, and a tall church tower in the background under a light blue sky.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1-32x25.png 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1-375x294.png 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1-768x603.png 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png 978w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/mattimuspr1me_Downtown_Zurich_floating_illustration_with_irre_a65bdc1f-95f0-4404-bfa3-acb9a14abe73_2-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-contain top-0 left-0 mix-blend-multiply\" />\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <p data-slide-text class=\"w-grid24-col-span-12 mb-76fx m:w-full m:px-20fx\">\n                                Lake Zurich, the Alps, and Swiss precision, home to some of Europe’s sharpest engineering minds and a deep belief in doing things exactly right.                            </p>\n                            <a href=\"/careers\" section-focus=\"\" data-slide-button=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore Zurich Jobs\" class=\"button--primary cta-arrow-center\" >\n            Explore Jobs\n        </a>                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                                            </div>\n\n        </div>\n \n    </div>\n</block-locations>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section\n    class=\"relative mt-214fx mb-320fx m:my-80fx\"\n  data-bg-fade=\"#F7ECD9\"\n  data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n  style=\"z-index: 1; background: #F7ECD9;\"\n  >\n  <div class=\"max-width-max mx-auto px-grid24-col-offset-2 m:px-0\">\n\n    <scroll-object class=\"block rounded-5fx overflow-hidden\">\n      \n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center  mlg:block m:block m:px-0\">\n\n        <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-10 mlg:w-full mlg:mb-60fx m:w-full m:mb-20fx\">\n          <div class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-5fx\" >\n                              <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A man with short curly hair and glasses, wearing a dark sweater, speaks into a microphone while gesturing with his hand. He stands in front of a backdrop of blue and green curtains.\" srcset=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2-32x37.jpg 32w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2-375x429.jpg 375w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2-768x879.jpg 768w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2-1024x1172.jpg 1024w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg 1080w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg 1080w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg 1080w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg 1080w,https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg 1080w\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Screenshot-2026-03-24-at-10.58.48-AM-2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"  class=\"w-full scale-out\" />\n                                                    </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"w-grid24-col-span-8 mlg:w-full m:w-full m:text-center\">\n\n          \n                    \n                    \n                      <div class=\"m:px-21fx m:text-center m:mt-54fx\">\n                <div class=\"article-quote mb-24fx\" style=\"--animation-delay: 0.3s;\">\n                  <split-text by=\"lines\">\n                    We are building a practical superintelligence, rooted in the challenges of real people and businesses. This is the world’s most advanced AI designed to address our biggest problems and always remain under human control.                   </split-text>\n                </div>\n                              <div class=\" \">\n                                      <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://microsoft.ai/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mustafa-Signature-Fill-1-300x254-1.png\" alt=\"Signature\" class=\"w-grid24-col-span-3 mb-16fx m:w-[125px] m:mb-0 fade-in\" style=\"--animation-delay: 1s;\" />\n                                                        <p class=\"text-caption mt-40fx fade-in\" style=\"--animation-delay: 1.1s;\">\n                        Mustafa Suleyman<br />\r\nCEO Microsoft AI                    </p>\n                                  </div>\n                          </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n      </div>\n    </scroll-object>\n  </div>\n</section>    </main>\n\n\n\n            <footer \n    id=\"site-footer\"\n    class=\"max-width-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-24 gap-20fx font-sans pb-[27px] m:block m:space-y-40fx\"\n    data-bg-fade=\"#FEF9ED\"\n    data-color-fade=\"#5D524B\"\n    >\n\n    <div class=\"col-span-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Home MAI link\">\n            <svg class=\"w-[54px]\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 26\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                <path d=\"M55.1321 10.9639C55.1321 7.20253 55.2011 4.64896 55.4082 0.922134H51.5088C51.7158 4.64896 51.7849 7.20253 51.7849 10.9639V15.0358C51.7849 18.7971 51.7158 21.3852 51.5088 25.